Source: rk3588-camera-overlays
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Peyton Howe <peyton@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), device-tree-compiler, gcc
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/peyton-howe/ubuntu-image-builder

Package: rk3588-camera-overlays
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, u-boot-menu | u-boot-tools
Description: Device-tree overlays for RK3588 cameras
 One overlay per sensor (imx708, imx219, imx519, imx415, ov5647, imx477)
 plus the ISP overlays. The per-board CSI port overlays come from the
 rk3588-board-* packages. Select a camera with
 /etc/rk3588-camera/overlays.conf in Raspberry Pi syntax
 (imx708,port0). apply-overlays.sh bakes port, 4lane, and
 link-frequency into the dtbo U-Boot loads.
